96
00:10:54,395 --> 00:10:55,695
<b><font color=#FFFF00><i>Clara?</i></font></b>

97
00:10:56,270 --> 00:10:57,570
<b><font color=#FFFF00><i>Alô?</i></font></b>

98
00:10:58,978 --> 00:11:00,278
