111
00:11:28,935 --> 00:11:30,643
<b><font color=#FFFF00><i>Acharam o celular dela?</i></font></b>

112
00:11:31,018 --> 00:11:34,558
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Nada a dizer no momento.
Pode se identificar, senhorita?</font></b>

113
00:11:34,559 --> 00:11:35,934
<b><font color=#FFFF00>É Nanie do quê?</font></b>

114
00:11:36,976 --> 00:11:38,893
<b><font color=#FFFF00><i>Béguin. Stéphanie Béguin.</i></font></b>

115
00:11:51,392 --> 00:11:52,892
<b><font color=#FFFF00>É você quem vai falar?</font></b>

116
00:11:54,433 --> 00:11:55,766
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Se você quiser.</font></b>

117
00:11:55,767 --> 00:11:57,142
