120
00:12:05,724 --> 00:12:07,024
<b><font color=#FFFF00>O que foi?</font></b>

121
00:12:07,641 --> 00:12:09,098
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Sra. Royer?</font></b>

122
00:12:09,099 --> 00:12:10,399
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Sim.</font></b>

123
00:12:14,474 --> 00:12:16,141
<b><font color=#FFFF00>- Olá, senhora.
- Olá.</font></b>

124
00:12:19,599 --> 00:12:21,349
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Somos da polícia.</font></b>

125
00:12:21,964 --> 00:12:23,264
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Sim...?</font></b>

126
00:12:23,265 --> 00:12:24,724
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Do que se trata?</font></b>

127
00:12:26,973 --> 00:12:28,640
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Poderíamos entrar, por favor?</font></b>

128
00:12:29,848 --> 00:12:31,148
<b><font color=#FFFF00>O que houve?</font></b>

129
00:12:31,765 --> 00:12:33,264
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Algum problema?</font></b>

130
00:12:33,265 --> 00:12:35,223
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Vamos para dentro,
