140
00:13:18,138 --> 00:13:19,846
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Temos motivos para pensar...</font></b>

141
00:13:25,512 --> 00:13:26,812
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Yohan...</font></b>

142
00:13:31,054 --> 00:13:33,845
