773
00:52:50,811 --> 00:52:52,143
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Como assim?</font></b>

774
00:52:52,144 --> 00:52:53,685
<b><font color=#FFFF00>O que ela contou a você?</font></b>

775
00:52:54,144 --> 00:52:56,310
