814
00:55:21,970 --> 00:55:23,511
<b><font color=#FFFF00>ela era minha melhor amiga.</font></b>

815
00:55:27,678 --> 00:55:28,978
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Sinto saudade dela.</font></b>

816
00:55:52,920 --> 00:55:54,425
<b><font color=#FFFF00>Onde comprou o isqueiro?</font></b>

817
00:55:54,426 --> 00:55:56,343
